  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n81³/⁴ + [(20 ÷ 5 of 3 × 6) + {(8 ÷ 24 of 3) × 4} - 10 ÷ 5] - ((1)/(32))⁻⁽²/⁵⁾ \n\n**Concept:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c2bb90de781b2f627e60faceff021004b44b47d91186a4e09aae391b5d72e172.png] \n\n**Calculations:**\n\nAccording to the question,\n\n(81)³/⁴ + [(20 ÷ 5 of 3 × 6) + {(8 ÷ 24 of 3) × 4} - 10 ÷ 5] - (1/32)⁻²/⁵ \n\n⇒ [(81)1/4]3 + [(20 ÷ (5 × 3) × 6) + {(8 ÷ (24 × 3)) × 4} - 2] - [(1/32)1/5]⁻² \n\n⇒ [3]3 + [((20 ÷ 15) × 6) + {(8 ÷ 72) × 4} - 2] - [1/2]-2 \n\n⇒ 27 + [((4/3) × 6) + {(1/9) × 4} - 2] - [2]2 \n\n⇒ 27 + [(4 × 2) + {4/9} - 2] - 4 \n\n⇒ 27 + [8 + {4/9} - 2] - 4 \n\n⇒ 27 - 4 + [6 + {4/9}] \n\n⇒ 23 + [54 + 4]/9\n\n⇒ 23 + 58/9\n\n⇒ (207 + 58) / 9 = 265/9 or 29 (4)/(9)\n\n**∴ The simplified value is 29 (4)/(9).**",
